  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "과학과 기술에 관한 글에서는 발전의 장점과 단점, 윤리적 문제를 균형 있게 다룹니다. 어휘는 develop, invent, automate, innovate와 research, experiment, discovery를 알아 둡니다. 미래 예측은 be expected to, be likely to, will probably로, 의존은 rely on, depend on으로 표현합니다. 의견을 말할 때는 장점(It makes it possible to …), 단점(there is a risk that …), 조건(as long as …)을 대비해서 쓰면 균형이 잡힙니다.",
   "en": "Texts on science and technology weigh advances against drawbacks and ethical issues. Know develop, invent, automate, innovate and research, experiment, discovery. Predict with be expected to, be likely to, will probably; show dependence with rely on, depend on. Balance your view: advantages (It makes it possible to …), drawbacks (there is a risk that …), conditions (as long as …)."
  },
